WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.001
Hi, everybody!

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:03.670
<i>I think we’re gonna have some fun.</i>

00:00:03.753 --> 00:00:05.213
Talk about some hard stuff,

00:00:05.296 --> 00:00:08.383
laugh a little bit, and hopefully
learn something from each other.

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:11.010
How many of you know
that I’m super introverted?

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:13.972
It’s handy when I’m traveling
because, like,

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:15.432
I’ll be sitting next to someone
and they’ll say,

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:16.349
“So, what do you do?”

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.517
And if I’m not in the mood to chat,

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.436
I’ll be like,
“I study shame. What do you do?”

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:20.812
<i>They’re just like...</i>

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:26.526
How many of you want more love,
intimacy, joy?

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:32.073
True belonging doesn’t require you
to change who you are.

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:33.992
It requires you to be who you are.

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:37.495
You don’t measure vulnerability
by the amount of disclosure.

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:40.957
Live-tweeting your bikini wax:
not vulnerability.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.710
I’m not going to bullshit you.

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:47.213 position:59%
Vulnerability is hard, and it’s scary,
and it feels dangerous.

00:00:47.338 --> 00:00:49.758 position:66%
<i>But it’s not as hard or scary or dangerous</i>

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:53.261
as getting to the end of our lives
and having to ask ourselves,

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:55.472
"What if I would’ve shown up?"

